Chapter: Prism
  cites Prism chapter PrismRoutes
  cites Net chapter WebServer
  cites Works chapter WebRoute

 The BARE-METAL entry. The catalogue and the route function live in
 `PrismRoutes`, which carries no transport; the hosted entry is `PrismHosted`.
 One route function, two entries.

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console, Network.Read, Network.Write] Integer = act
    let sources = prism-make-path-entries prism-source-paths 0 []
    in let ir-cache = prism-make-path-entries prism-ir-paths 0 []
    in act
      print-line-uni ("[prism] " & show (list-length sources) & " source paths catalogued")
      print-line-uni "[prism] starting web server on port 9200"
      web-serve (prism-route sources ir-cache) web-observe-none
    end
  end

